1	/****************************************************************************
2	 * apps/examples/xiaozhi_voice/xiaozhi_main.c
3	 *
4	 * Xiaozhi AI Voice App — Phase 2 entry point.
5	 *
6	 * Full dialog: OTA -> wss connect -> hello -> listen start -> mic capture
7	 * (Opus uplink) -> listen stop -> receive stt/tts -> TTS Opus playback.
8	 *
9	 * The dialog runs in a worker thread; the main thread drives the LVGL
10	 * event loop and reflects the dialog state on screen so it is obvious
11	 * whether the app launched and how far it got.
12	 *
13	 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
14	 ****************************************************************************/
