This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   - **Original request (previous context)**: User reported "语音识别效果太差，与真实语音内容严重不符" (voice recognition effect is too poor, doesn't match actual speech content) in the xiaozhi_voice project. This was fixed by correcting frame duration (40→60ms) and sample rate (16000→24000Hz) mismatches.
   - **Current request**: User provided a new boot log showing the device freezes when clicking to enter xiaozhi_voice ("点击进入xiaozhi_voice直接卡死"). The user wants this freeze/crash issue diagnosed and fixed.

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - Best1700 chip with NuttX RTOS, multi-core (AP, APC1/APC1/BTH/DSP)
   - LVGL v9 graphics framework for watch UI
   - Opus audio codec (24kHz mono, VOIP mode, 60ms frames)
   - WebSocket-over-TLS (wss) communication with xiaozhi AI server
   - Media recorder (SMF framework) for PCM audio capture
   - MCP (Model Context Protocol) tool server
   - pthread-based dialog thread with configurable stack size
   - App launcher pattern: nav_enter_app() → app_start() → UI creation

3. Files and Code Sections:
   - `/home/ts/bes-watch-common-clean/bes-watch-common/rtos/apps/examples/tswatch/xiaozhi_voice/xiaozhi_main.c`
     - Main application file containing UI creation, dialog thread, and entry point
     - **Debug traces added to xiaozhi_voice_start()**:
       ```c
       void xiaozhi_voice_start(void)
       {
         printf("[xiaozhi] ==================xiaozhi_voice_start==================\n");
         if (xiaozhi_container != NULL)
           {
             lv_obj_clear_flag(xiaozhi_container, LV_OBJ_FLAG_HIDDEN);
             return;
           }
         printf("[xiaozhi] init app state\n");
         memset(&g_app, 0, sizeof(g_app));
         g_app.state = XZ_STATE_BOOT;
         printf("[xiaozhi] init font manager\n");
         font_manager_init();
         printf("[xiaozhi] create UI\n");
         ui_create(&g_app);
         printf("[xiaozhi] start UI refresh timer\n");
         if (ui_refresh_timer == NULL)
           {
             ui_refresh_timer = lv_timer_create(ui_refresh_timer_cb, 100, NULL);
           }
         printf("[xiaozhi] xiaozhi_voice_start done\n");
       }
       ```
     - **Debug traces added to ui_create()**:
